{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "de7e75b4b5c6ad472cc0443c0d027bf1c84ebdcb883bedb9947a5c8241c6f75d",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0001",
      "text": "RiskEngine.twapEMA() tuple destructuring mismatch ignores eonsEMA and includes spotEMA, breaking TWAP manipulation resistance used in liquidation checks",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 152,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0002",
      "text": "## Root Cause",
      "start": 154,
      "end": 167,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0003",
      "text": "`RiskEngine.twapEMA()` ([RiskEngine.sol#L836-L840](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/RiskEngine.sol#L836-L840)) destructures the return values of `OraclePack.getEMAs()` ([OraclePack.sol#L209-L214](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/types/OraclePack.sol#L209-L214)) in the wrong order.",
      "start": 169,
      "end": 518,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0004",
      "text": "**`getEMAs()` returns:** `(spotEMA, fastEMA, slowEMA, eonsEMA, medianTick)`",
      "start": 520,
      "end": 595,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0005",
      "text": "**`twapEMA()` destructures as:** `(eonsEMA, slowEMA, fastEMA, , )`",
      "start": 597,
      "end": 663,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0006",
      "text": "| Position | `getEMAs()` Returns | Variable in `twapEMA()` | Actual Value | Weight |",
      "start": 665,
      "end": 749,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0007",
      "text": "|----------|---------------------|-------------------------|--------------|--------|",
      "start": 750,
      "end": 834,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0008",
      "text": "| 1st | `_spotEMA` | `eonsEMA` | **spotEMA** ❌ | 10% |",
      "start": 835,
      "end": 889,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0009",
      "text": "| 2nd | `_fastEMA` | `slowEMA` | **fastEMA** ❌ | 30% |",
      "start": 890,
      "end": 944,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0010",
      "text": "| 3rd | `_slowEMA` | `fastEMA` | **slowEMA** ❌ | 60% |",
      "start": 945,
      "end": 999,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0011",
      "text": "| 4th | `_eonsEMA` | *(ignored)* | **discarded!** ❌ | 0% |",
      "start": 1000,
      "end": 1058,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0012",
      "text": "**Intended formula:** `(6 * fastEMA + 3 * slowEMA + eonsEMA) / 10`",
      "start": 1060,
      "end": 1126,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0013",
      "text": "**Actual formula:** `(6 * slowEMA + 3 * fastEMA + spotEMA) / 10`",
      "start": 1128,
      "end": 1192,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0014",
      "text": "The helper accessors in [OraclePack.sol#L169-L200](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/types/OraclePack.sol#L169-L200) confirm the correct return order.",
      "start": 1194,
      "end": 1377,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0015",
      "text": "## Impact",
      "start": 1379,
      "end": 1388,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0016",
      "text": "Per the NatSpec: *\"This heavily smoothed value is designed to be highly resistant to manipulation and serves as a robust price feed for critical system functions like solvency checks.\"*",
      "start": 1390,
      "end": 1575,
      "line": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0017",
      "text": "**However, the implementation computes a 60/30/10 blend of (slow, fast, spot) instead of (fast, slow, eons). `eonsEMA` has zero influence on the returned TWAP.**",
      "start": 1577,
      "end": 1738,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0018",
      "text": "This TWAP is used in `PanopticPool.getTWAP()` ([PanopticPool.sol#L1944-L1945](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/PanopticPool.sol#L1944-L1945)) which feeds into:",
      "start": 1740,
      "end": 1933,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0019",
      "text": "- Liquidation solvency checks (`atTicks[1] = twapTick`) ([PanopticPool.sol#L1392-L1397](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/PanopticPool.sol#L1392-L1397))",
      "start": 1934,
      "end": 2119,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0020",
      "text": "- `StaleOracle` gate: `|currentTick - twapTick| > tickDeltaLiquidation` ([PanopticPool.sol#L1378-L1389](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/main/contracts/PanopticPool.sol#L1378-L1389))",
      "start": 2120,
      "end": 2321,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0021",
      "text": "- `_settlePremium()` and `_forceExercise()` pricing",
      "start": 2322,
      "end": 2373,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0022",
      "text": "If short-horizon price movement propagates into `spotEMA` faster than longer-horizon EMAs:",
      "start": 2375,
      "end": 2465,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0023",
      "text": "1. The buggy TWAP incorporates that movement with 10% weight (should be 0%)",
      "start": 2466,
      "end": 2541,
      "line": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0024",
      "text": "2. This alters outcomes of the `StaleOracle` safety boundary and solvency evaluation",
      "start": 2542,
      "end": 2626,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0025",
      "text": "3. System may proceed when it should revert as stale, or revert when it should proceed",
      "start": 2627,
      "end": 2713,
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0026",
      "text": "**Impacts liquidation correctness and liveness:**",
      "start": 2715,
      "end": 2764,
      "line": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0027",
      "text": "- Blocked liquidations → bad debt may accumulate",
      "start": 2765,
      "end": 2813,
      "line": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "e_de7e75b4b5c6_0028",
      "text": "- Incorrect liquidations → borderline solvent accounts may be flagged insolvent",
      "start": 2814,
      "end": 2893,
      "line": 42
    }
  ]
}
